Package: sdlrm
Type: Package
Title: Sdl Regression for Integer-Valued Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Rodrigo", "Matheus",
    email = "rodrigo.matheus@live.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implementation of the SDL regression model. Provide a set
    of functions for a complete analysis of integer-valued data, in
    which it is assumed that the dependent variable follows a Skew
    Discrete Laplace (SDL) distribution. This regression model is also
    useful for the analysis of experimental studies in which a paired
    count data is observed.
URL: https://github.com/Rodrigo-sgj/sdlrm
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports: 
    Formula (>= 1.2.3),
    Rfast
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
